  "caseId": "case19",
  "description": "The no-match outcome, which is the property of YYYY-STORE-PFKEY easiest to lose. The EVALUATE in app/cpy/CSSTRPFY.cpy has NO WHEN OTHER, no DFHPA3 branch, and it does not clear CCARD-AID first, so an unrecognised EIBAID leaves the field holding whatever was there - here the five spaces INITIALIZE CC-WORK-AREA put in it at :254. Five spaces satisfies neither CCARD-AID-ENTER nor CCARD-AID-PFK03, so :297-299 coerces it to ENTER and the screen is redisplayed. A translation that defaulted the resolver to ENTER instead of returning no match would pass this case for the wrong reason, which is why case15 pins a key that must NOT be coerced.",
